---
import TextPage from '../../components/TextPage.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../config/site';
---
<TextPage title={`Editorial Policy | ${SITE.name}`} description={`How ${SITE.name} writes, reviews and corrects its guides, including our use of AI.`} h1="Editorial policy" path="/editorial-policy/">
  <h2>How guides are made</h2>
  <p>Our guides are <b>AI-assisted and human-reviewed</b>. A first draft is written with an AI language model from a brief that tells it to answer the question in the first two sentences, include a worked example with real dates, avoid filler and never invent facts or statistics. Every draft then goes through human review before it is published — nothing is published automatically.</p>
  <h2>What reviewers check</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Every date in a worked example is checked against our own calculators.</li>
    <li>Holiday rules and official facts are checked against government or primary sources.</li>
    <li>Claims we can’t verify are removed.</li>
    <li>Each guide links to at least one tool so readers can check their own dates.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Accuracy of the tools</h2>
  <p>All calculators share one date engine with automated tests for leap years, month ends, business days and time zones.</p>
  <h2>Corrections</h2>
  <p>Found a mistake? Tell us via the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>. We fix confirmed errors promptly and update the “Updated” date on the guide.</p>
  <h2>Independence</h2>
  <p>Advertising does not influence what we write. We do not accept payment for coverage in guides.</p>
  <p>Author: <a href="/about/">{SITE.author.name}</a>.</p>
</TextPage>
